      'All three completed lines belong to this Qwen3-1.7B OpenEVO study family. Stage 2 runs for 160 rounds. Bounded Online Recurrence and Bounded Online Recurrence + β-gating (α=1) form the formal matched pair with 128 rollouts per round and matched tasks, seeds, sampling, horizon, replay, and optimizer recipe. Dynamic α + dynamic β has not been run and is not part of this formal contrast.',
