      'All three finals use exactly the same fixed 128 tasks, so they support a side-by-side comparison on this panel. The scores 60.72, 45.98, and 20.77 should not be read as comprehensive model capability. The panel-selection and Task Score definitions are stated at the top of the page.',
    )}</p>

    {finalResult ? (
      <>
        <h3>4.3 {t('后两组的正式长期对照：β-gating（α=1）的短暂正向信号没有形成稳定优势', 'Formal long-horizon contrast between the latter two: the transient β-gating (α=1) signal does not become a stable advantage')}</h3>
