  <section class="paper__section" id="analysis" aria-labelledby="analysis-title">
    <p class="paper__section-number">5</p>
    <h2 id="analysis-title">{t('Analysis：为什么 β-gating（α=1）这一组后期会掉下来？', 'Analysis: why does the β-gating (α=1) line fall late?')}</h2>

    <div id="parameters">
      <h3>5.1 {t('Task Vector、范数和谱：没有一个指标能直接解释分数', 'Task Vector, norms, and spectra: no single metric directly explains score')}</h3>
      <p>{t(
        `普通 OpenEVO 里，直接算相关性时，state Frobenius 和 Task Score 的 Spearman ρ=${study.posthocAnalysis.parameterScore.stateFroSpearmanRaw.toFixed(2)}，Task Vector Frobenius 也有 ρ=${study.posthocAnalysis.parameterScore.taskVectorSpearmanRaw.toFixed(2)}。但把每 20 轮里共同的“越训越后”趋势去掉后，相关分别只剩 ${study.posthocAnalysis.parameterScore.stateFroWithin20Pearson.toFixed(3)} 和 +${study.posthocAnalysis.parameterScore.taskVectorWithin20Pearson.toFixed(3)}。`,
        `In ordinary OpenEVO, raw correlations look substantial: state Frobenius vs Task Score has Spearman ρ=${study.posthocAnalysis.parameterScore.stateFroSpearmanRaw.toFixed(2)}, and Task Vector Frobenius reaches ρ=${study.posthocAnalysis.parameterScore.taskVectorSpearmanRaw.toFixed(2)}. After removing the common within-20-round training trend, the correlations shrink to ${study.posthocAnalysis.parameterScore.stateFroWithin20Pearson.toFixed(3)} and +${study.posthocAnalysis.parameterScore.taskVectorWithin20Pearson.toFixed(3)}.`,
      )}</p>
      <p>{t(
        `用当前 Task Vector 预测后 5 轮分数时，95% block-bootstrap 区间仍是 ${study.posthocAnalysis.parameterScore.taskVectorFuture5Ci95[0].toFixed(3)} → +${study.posthocAnalysis.parameterScore.taskVectorFuture5Ci95[1].toFixed(3)}，跨过 0。现在不能说“Task Vector / norm 越大，WebShop 就越好”。`,
        `For a five-round-ahead prediction from the current Task Vector, the 95% block-bootstrap interval remains ${study.posthocAnalysis.parameterScore.taskVectorFuture5Ci95[0].toFixed(3)} → +${study.posthocAnalysis.parameterScore.taskVectorFuture5Ci95[1].toFixed(3)}, crossing zero. We cannot say that a larger Task Vector or norm is intrinsically better for WebShop.`,
      )}</p>
    </div>

    <div id="posthoc">
      <h3>5.2 {t('后期差异不只是“更新被压小”，更新方向也变了', 'The late difference is not only smaller updates; direction changes too')}</h3>
      <p>{t(
        `R159 时，β-gating（α=1）这一组的本轮更新大小约为纯 Bounded Online Recurrence 的 ${(study.posthocAnalysis.directionMagnitudeR159.updateNormRatioOnOff * 100).toFixed(1)}%，只小约 11%；但两边更新方向的 cosine 已经是 ${study.posthocAnalysis.directionMagnitudeR159.updateCosineOnOff.toFixed(3)}。第 19–27 层平均 cosine 进一步到 ${study.posthocAnalysis.directionMagnitudeR159.lateLayerUpdateCosineMean.toFixed(3)}。`,
        `At R159, the β-gating (α=1) update is about ${(study.posthocAnalysis.directionMagnitudeR159.updateNormRatioOnOff * 100).toFixed(1)}% the size of plain Bounded Online Recurrence, only about 11% smaller, while the update-direction cosine is already ${study.posthocAnalysis.directionMagnitudeR159.updateCosineOnOff.toFixed(3)}. Across layers 19–27, the mean cosine falls further to ${study.posthocAnalysis.directionMagnitudeR159.lateLayerUpdateCosineMean.toFixed(3)}.`,
      )}</p>
      <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
        `这说明 β-gating（α=1）后期不是简单把同一个更新缩短；两条线在往不同方向走。不过方向差异本身还没有被证明是掉分原因：目前只有 ${study.posthocAnalysis.exploratoryAssociation.anchorCount} 个锚点，最强的状态大小比趋势 exact permutation p=${study.posthocAnalysis.exploratoryAssociation.exactPermutationP.toFixed(3)}，仍未显著。`,
        `This shows that late β-gating (α=1) is not simply shortening the same update; the two lines move in different directions. But direction divergence itself is not yet proven to cause the score drop: there are only ${study.posthocAnalysis.exploratoryAssociation.anchorCount} anchors, and the strongest state-size-ratio trend has exact permutation p=${study.posthocAnalysis.exploratoryAssociation.exactPermutationP.toFixed(3)}.`,
      )}</p>

      <h3>5.3 {t('输出长度和步数：三条线都变短，但 β-gating（α=1）后期路径重新变长', 'Output length and steps: all three get shorter, but the β-gating (α=1) path lengthens again late')}</h3>
      <p>{t(
        '这里的 token 数来自保存下来的 raw completion，用 Qwen3-1.7B tokenizer 重新计算；每个窗口都是 32 轮的均值。先看 R0–31 和 R128–159：三条线的单步输出和整条 episode 总输出都明显变短，但 β-gating（α=1）这一组的步数下降得最少。',
        'Token counts are recomputed from saved raw completions with the Qwen3-1.7B tokenizer; each window is a 32-round mean. Comparing R0–31 with R128–159, all three lines become much shorter per step and per episode, but the β-gating (α=1) line reduces its step count the least.',
      )}</p>
      <div class="paper-table-wrap">
        <table class="paper-table paper-table--dense-results">
          <thead><tr><th>{t('方法 / 窗口', 'Method / window')}</th><th>{t('每步输出', 'tokens / step')}</th><th>{t('Episode 总输出', 'episode tokens')}</th><th>{t('平均步骤', 'steps')}</th><th>Task Score</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>{names.baseline} · R0–31</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlyStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlyEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlySteps.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlyScore.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>{names.baseline} · R128–159</td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateScore.toFixed(3)}</strong></td></tr>
            <tr><td>{names.bounded} · R0–31</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.earlyStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.earlyEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.earlySteps.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.earlyScore.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>{names.bounded} · R128–159</td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.bounded.lateScore.toFixed(3)}</strong></td></tr>
            <tr><td>{names.gdr} · R0–31</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.earlyStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.earlyEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.earlySteps.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.earlyScore.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>{names.gdr} · R128–159</td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateScore.toFixed(3)}</strong></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p>{t(
        `普通 OpenEVO 从每步 ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlyStepTokens.toFixed(1)} → ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)} tokens，整条 episode 从 ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlyEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)} → ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)} tokens，步骤 ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlySteps.toFixed(2)} → ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}，同时 Task Score ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlyScore.toFixed(3)} → ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateScore.toFixed(3)}。Bounded Online Recurrence 也呈现同样方向。β-gating（α=1）这一组虽然单步同样变短，但后期平均仍要 ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateSteps.toFixed(2)} 步。`,
        `Ordinary OpenEVO falls from ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlyStepTokens.toFixed(1)} to ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)} tokens per step, from ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlyEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)} to ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)} tokens per episode, and from ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlySteps.toFixed(2)} to ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateSteps.toFixed(2)} steps, while Task Score rises from ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.earlyScore.toFixed(3)} to ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.ordinary.lateScore.toFixed(3)}. Bounded Online Recurrence shows the same direction. The β-gating (α=1) line also gets shorter per step, but still needs ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateSteps.toFixed(2)} steps late.`,
      )}</p>

      <h4>{t('β-gating（α=1）最后 64 轮的转折', 'The β-gating (α=1) turn in the final 64 rounds')}</h4>
      <div class="paper-table-wrap">
        <table class="paper-table paper-table--dense-results">
          <thead><tr><th>{t('窗口', 'Window')}</th><th>{t('每步输出', 'tokens / step')}</th><th>{t('Episode 总输出', 'episode tokens')}</th><th>{t('Action tokens', 'action tokens')}</th><th>{t('平均步骤', 'steps')}</th><th>Task Score</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>R96–127</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midActionTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midSteps.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midScore.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>R128–159</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)}</td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateActionTokens.toFixed(1)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateScore.toFixed(3)}</strong></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="paper__boundary">{t(
        `这里最值得注意：每一步 ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midStepTokens.toFixed(1)} → ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)} tokens，基本没有变长；但 episode 总输出 ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)} → ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}，平均步骤 ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midSteps.toFixed(2)} → ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}，同时 Task Score ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midScore.toFixed(3)} → ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateScore.toFixed(3)}。所以“后期掉分 = 每一步变啰嗦”这个解释不成立；更直接的变化是任务路径重新变长。`,
        `The key point is that tokens per step stay nearly flat (${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midStepTokens.toFixed(1)} → ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateStepTokens.toFixed(1)}), while episode output rises from ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)} to ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateEpisodeTokens.toFixed(1)}, mean steps rise from ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midSteps.toFixed(2)} to ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateSteps.toFixed(2)}, and Task Score falls from ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.midScore.toFixed(3)} to ${study.posthocAnalysis.outputLength.linearConstraint.lateScore.toFixed(3)}. The late drop is therefore not explained by more verbose individual steps; the task path itself becomes longer.`,
      )}</p>

      <h3>5.4 Entropy：{t('行为分布越来越集中，β-gating（α=1）这一组最明显；但这不是 token entropy', 'Action distribution becomes more concentrated, especially with β-gating (α=1); this is not token entropy')}</h3>
      <p>{t(
        '这里能可靠重建的是 action-family entropy：把每一轮所有有效动作按 search / click 等类型统计，计算 Shannon entropy（自然对数），再在 32 轮窗口内取平均。数值越低，表示动作类型越集中。三条正式 rollout 没有保存逐 token logits / logprobs，所以真正的 predictive token entropy 仍然不能从文本补出来。',
        'What can be reconstructed reliably is action-family entropy: count valid actions such as search and click in each round, compute Shannon entropy with natural log, then average within 32-round windows. Lower values mean a more concentrated action-type distribution. The formal rollouts did not persist per-token logits/logprobs, so predictive token entropy still cannot be reconstructed from text.',
      )}</p>
      {study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy ? (
        <div class="paper-table-wrap">
          <table class="paper-table paper-table--dense-results">
            <thead><tr><th>{t('方法', 'Method')}</th><th>R0–31 mean H</th><th>R128–159 mean H</th><th>R159 H</th><th>R159 search</th><th>R159 click</th><th>{t('有效动作', 'valid actions')}</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>{names.baseline}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.ordinaryEarly.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.ordinaryLate.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.ordinary.entropy.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.ordinary.search}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.ordinary.click}</td><td>100%</td></tr>
              <tr><td>{names.bounded}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.boundedEarly.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.boundedLate.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.bounded.entropy.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.bounded.search}</td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.bounded.click}</td><td>100%</td></tr>
              <tr><td>{names.gdr}</td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.gdrEarly.toFixed(4)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.gdrLate.toFixed(4)}</strong></td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.entropy.toFixed(4)}</strong></td><td>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.search}</td><td><strong>{study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.click}</strong></td><td>100%</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      ) : null}
      <p>{t(
        `窗口均值上，普通 OpenEVO 的行为 entropy ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.ordinaryEarly.toFixed(4)} → ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.ordinaryLate.toFixed(4)}，Bounded Online Recurrence ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.boundedEarly.toFixed(4)} → ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.boundedLate.toFixed(4)}，β-gating（α=1）组 ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.gdrEarly.toFixed(4)} → ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.gdrLate.toFixed(4)}。到 R159，这一组只有 ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.search} 次 search，却有 ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.click} 次 click，H=${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.entropy.toFixed(4)}；而且三条线 action valid rate 都是 100%。所以这个变化不是 parser / 非法动作造成的，而是有效策略行为本身更集中。`,
        `Window means fall from ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.ordinaryEarly.toFixed(4)} to ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.ordinaryLate.toFixed(4)} for ordinary OpenEVO, ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.boundedEarly.toFixed(4)} to ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.boundedLate.toFixed(4)} for Bounded Online Recurrence, and ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.gdrEarly.toFixed(4)} to ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.gdrLate.toFixed(4)} for β-gating (α=1). At R159, this line has ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.search} search actions but ${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.click} clicks, with H=${study.posthocAnalysis.behaviorEntropy.r159.gdr.entropy.toFixed(4)}. All three lines have a 100% action-valid rate, so this concentration is not a parser or invalid-action artifact.`,
      )}</p>
      <p class="paper__boundary">{t('行为 entropy 下降与后期掉分同时出现，但它仍然只是行为层相关现象。不能据此说“低 entropy 导致掉分”，更不能把它当成模型 token entropy。', 'Lower action entropy co-occurs with the late score change, but it remains a behavioral association. It does not establish that low entropy causes the score drop, and it is not model token entropy.')}</p>

      <p class="paper__links"><a href="/research/seed-openevo/evidence/wandb-threeway/output-length-analysis.json">{t('查看 160 轮完整输出长度 / 步数 JSON →', 'Open full 160-round output-length / step JSON →')}</a><a href="/research/seed-openevo/evidence/wandb-threeway/action-family-entropy.json">{t('查看 160 轮完整行为 entropy JSON →', 'Open full 160-round action-entropy JSON →')}</a></p>

      <h3>5.5 {t('下一问分成两层：先补动态 α，再研究 β 还该看什么', 'Two next questions: first test dynamic α, then ask what β should observe')}</h3>
      <p>{t(
        `现在的 β 已经不是固定系数：冻结 controller 每一步读取 ${study.posthocAnalysis.gdr.betaControllerFeatures} 个局部特征，再决定写多强。但它只知道局部参数、梯度和 Adam 状态，不知道 WebShop reward、Task Score 或 Task Vector。`,
        `Beta is already dynamic rather than fixed: the frozen controller reads ${study.posthocAnalysis.gdr.betaControllerFeatures} local features at each step and chooses write strength. But it only knows local parameters, gradients, and Adam state; it does not see WebShop reward, Task Score, or Task Vector.`,
      )}</p>
      <p>{t(
        '第一层缺口更基础：这次正式实验把 α 固定为 1，所以“动态 α + 动态 β”尚未做，结果暂时留空。只有完成一条新的前瞻实验，才能回答主动保留 / 遗忘旧 State 是否改变结论。',
        'The first gap is more basic: this formal study fixes α at 1, so dynamic α + dynamic β has not been run and its result is intentionally blank. Only a new prospective experiment can test whether active retention / forgetting of prior State changes the conclusion.',
      )}</p>
      <p>{t(
        '第二层才是 β controller 的信息问题：可以在新的前瞻实验里加入 layer / round / 历史更新方向等信息，看它能不能区分该压的噪声和应该保留的有效更新；不能拿已经看到的 Final 回头调当前实验。',
        'The second question concerns controller information: a new prospective study could add layer, round, or historical update-direction features and test whether β better separates noise from useful updates. The completed final cannot be used to tune the finished study retrospectively.',
      )}</p>
    </div>

  </section>

